  "details": "There seems to be a noticeable input lag when trying to jump at lower framerates (around 30 or lower). I've noticed up to half second delays from button press to jumping, with some inputs being ignored entirely. Only tested in desktop mode during community meetup, but I assume it's the same in VR (as it was the last time jumping input inconsistencies were introduced). Behavior is fine at normal framerates.",
